  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{r}}={ }^{1016} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}(5)^{\\frac{1016-\\mathrm{r}}{2}} 7^{\\frac{\\mathrm{r}}{8}} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{r}=0,8,16,24, \\ldots ., 1016 \\\\\n& 1016=0+(\\mathrm{n}-1) 8 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{n}-1=\\frac{1016}{8}=127\n\\end{aligned}$\nSo, $\\mathrm{n}=128$.",
    "image": null
  },
